## SGG world lock

- `SEVENGODS Games` / `SGG`, under `SEVENDAO`
- `AI × IP × Games × Web3`
- Small build → fast release → validation → sequel for chosen projects
- Time axes: 7-day heat, 77-day growth / strategy / story, 777-day collective accumulation
- Seven canonical GODS–OTOMO pairs must not be rearranged as official pair canon.
- OTOMO forms are exactly `SPIRIT / INCARNATE / DOJI`.
- Discord user ID is the formal identity; Wallet is optional.
- Raw gameplay, ranking, `SGG_GAME_POINTS`, and external reward remain separate.

